      "text": "Llegamos al hotel y hablamos con el cliente.",
      "meaningEn": "We arrive at the hotel and we talk with the client.",
      "glosses": {
        "llegamos": "we arrive — 1st person plural of llegar",
        "al": "to the (a + el)",
        "hotel": "hotel",
        "y": "and",
        "hablamos": "we speak, we talk — 1st person plural of hablar",
        "con": "with",
        "el": "the (masculine)",
        "cliente": "client"
      },
      "image": "images/hotel.webp",
      "note": {
        "en": "For -ar verbs: -o is I, -a is he or she, -amos is we, -an is they. Example: hablo, habla, hablamos, hablan.",
        "es": "En los verbos en -ar: -o es yo, -a es él o ella, -amos es nosotros, -an es ellos. Ejemplo: hablo, habla, hablamos, hablan."
